repository-code: 'https://github.com/gmoulard/wikipedia2book'
url: 'https://wikipedia2book.toolforge.org/'
abstract: >-
  Wikipedia2Book is a web application that builds a printable PDF book
  from Wikipedia articles or from a Wikipedia book page: cover,
  introduction, chapters, table of contents, page numbers and license
  page. Each article is included through the official Wikipedia PDF,
  fitted to the chosen print format, and the server keeps no state.
